{"3594610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GET YOKED: Extreme Bodybuilding", "steam_appid": 3594610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Bodybuilding Roguelike Deckbuilder about one thing: GETTING YOKED.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/2b86fb64a79543cfecfa5932d715a482.poster.avif?t=1786016289\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/2b86fb64a79543cfecfa5932d715a482.webm?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/2b86fb64a79543cfecfa5932d715a482.mp4?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you ignore your dying mother so that you can keep working your glutes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/e186773705d222a6085e9803a9c312f3.poster.avif?t=1786016289\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/e186773705d222a6085e9803a9c312f3.webm?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/e186773705d222a6085e9803a9c312f3.mp4?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, and sculpt your body to win competitions. Reach the minimum gains required to win.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play workout cards to get <strong>Gains</strong>, e.g., play Arms to grow those guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't push too hard - too much <strong>Fatigue</strong> can lead to <strong>Injury</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play rest and supplement cards to increase your <strong>Gains</strong> or decrease muscle <strong>Fatigue</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Really into your Glutes? No problem become a Glutes purist and get those buns hun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to <strong>Gains</strong>-Town is difficult, make smart decisions on your journey to become a <strong>CHAMPION</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/eb3ead98bb7ece5ae01bc731e314655a.poster.avif?t=1786016289\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/eb3ead98bb7ece5ae01bc731e314655a.webm?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/eb3ead98bb7ece5ae01bc731e314655a.mp4?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play four different starting bodybuilders. Each with their own deck and playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization: complete competitions and unlock shorts, tattoos, hairstyles, shoes, and gloves to personalize your Bodybuilders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth campaign mode complete with harder difficulties, as well daily, endless, challenge and seeded runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/55f7b416489296b15dc1136896aeccc7.poster.avif?t=1786016289\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/55f7b416489296b15dc1136896aeccc7.webm?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/55f7b416489296b15dc1136896aeccc7.mp4?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Bodybuilding Roguelike Deckbuilder about one thing: GETTING YOKED.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/2b86fb64a79543cfecfa5932d715a482.poster.avif?t=1786016289\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/2b86fb64a79543cfecfa5932d715a482.webm?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/2b86fb64a79543cfecfa5932d715a482.mp4?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you ignore your dying mother so that you can keep working your glutes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/e186773705d222a6085e9803a9c312f3.poster.avif?t=1786016289\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/e186773705d222a6085e9803a9c312f3.webm?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/e186773705d222a6085e9803a9c312f3.mp4?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, and sculpt your body to win competitions. Reach the minimum gains required to win.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play workout cards to get <strong>Gains</strong>, e.g., play Arms to grow those guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't push too hard - too much <strong>Fatigue</strong> can lead to <strong>Injury</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play rest and supplement cards to increase your <strong>Gains</strong> or decrease muscle <strong>Fatigue</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Really into your Glutes? No problem become a Glutes purist and get those buns hun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to <strong>Gains</strong>-Town is difficult, make smart decisions on your journey to become a <strong>CHAMPION</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/eb3ead98bb7ece5ae01bc731e314655a.poster.avif?t=1786016289\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/eb3ead98bb7ece5ae01bc731e314655a.webm?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/eb3ead98bb7ece5ae01bc731e314655a.mp4?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play four different starting bodybuilders. Each with their own deck and playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization: complete competitions and unlock shorts, tattoos, hairstyles, shoes, and gloves to personalize your Bodybuilders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth campaign mode complete with harder difficulties, as well daily, endless, challenge and seeded runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/55f7b416489296b15dc1136896aeccc7.poster.avif?t=1786016289\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/55f7b416489296b15dc1136896aeccc7.webm?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/55f7b416489296b15dc1136896aeccc7.mp4?t=1786016289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A Bodybuilding Roguelike Deckbuilder about one thing: GETTING YOKED. Build your body as you build your deck. The path to the podium is difficult. Sacrifice your relationships, your bank account, and your dignity for the only thing that matters: GAINS.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/29bcb856e0f8556bdf996f54bd758fffcf77e597/header.jpg?t=1786016289", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/fec9aee194cb87d4aecbef39293b325f7e513718/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786016289", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/fec9aee194cb87d4aecbef39293b325f7e513718/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786016289", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>